sx-a11y/anchor-is-valid","The href attribute requires a valid value to be accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide a valid href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","jsx-a11y/alt-text","Invalid alt value for img. Use alt=\"\" for presentational images.","img elements must have an alt prop, either with meaningful text, or an empty string for decorative images.","jsx-a11y/iframe-has-title","<iframe> elements must have a unique title property."]